<h1>Results</h1>

<p class="site-lead">The retest is in progress. No new results are published yet.</p>

<h2>Planned retest</h2>
<p>A11y Intuition Lab will run every test case, each on its own page, with:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://github.com/dequelabs/axe-core">axe-core</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://pa11y.org/">pa11y</a>, using its HTML_CodeSniffer runner</li>
</ul>
<p>Tool versions will be pinned and the raw output stored, so the results can be reproduced.</p>

<h2>Original GOV.UK results (2017 to 2018)</h2>
<p>The GDS accessibility team tested 13 tools. Those results are not republished here. They remain available:</p>
<ul>
